Cell["CL9 9Q | S36 LEFT / RIGHT | Pauli rows and 10 repetitions", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"a8f90798-86ab-42a6-9627-4fad6c4bd3ec"],

Cell["\<\
Self-contained notebook. 1=X, 2=Y, 3=Z. Measured file basis_measurement0.txt \
corresponds to Mathematica row 1. The first user-provided list contains EIGHT \
Ys, not six. S36 supports d=1,2,3,4; h=1 is the default. LEFT and RIGHT are \
computed separately. Exact experimental numbers require local files.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5fa88eef-b7db-4061-85e8-5df4b15631ed"],

